{"c":[{"name":"20261008T080402Z-28411e2e4fbdeba1","text":"realfill-asks canned oracle: fill's 15 ms wall-clock candidate budget (GENERATOR_BUDGET_MS) flips a single run's Ask right->refused about 1 in 20 under load; rerun or loop one Ask before calling an oracle drop a regression (G35 b31-04, ask-17).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T080402Z-5b6ab755f2bbf6d7","text":"Scope-ask stand-ins read the field label with test/builders.ts scopeLabel (wording: Field: \"<label>\". Control: ...); never regex the wording in a test. An askAnswer with no picks is valid only beside a question's filling labels.","type":"note"}]}
